{"4541800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nothing Remains", "steam_appid": 4541800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing Remains</strong> is a short hack and slash action experience where you face AI-controlled enemies inside a collapsing simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone warrior empowered by a mysterious force of light, exploring sci-fi environments as you try to prevent the world from collapsing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay focuses on:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and responsive melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-based attacks and a ranged option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small-scale combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of a futuristic, atmospheric world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a more direct and compact experience, focused on atmosphere and concept rather than complex systems or deep progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nothing Remains was developed by a single creator as their first project.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is collapsing.<br>You are trying to stop it.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing Remains</strong> is a short hack and slash action experience where you face AI-controlled enemies inside a collapsing simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone warrior empowered by a mysterious force of light, exploring sci-fi environments as you try to prevent the world from collapsing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay focuses on:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and responsive melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-based attacks and a ranged option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small-scale combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa